Package: com.trollpados
Name: TrollPadOS
Version: 4.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: TrollPadOS iPadOS 18-inspired compatibility layer for jailbroken iPhone. Provides independently configurable iPad-style multitasking, Stage Manager, display management, Home Screen rotation, Dock, keyboard UI, global iPad traits, external display and PiP capability hooks. Supports rootless and rootful packaging.
Maintainer: TrollPadOS Project
Author: TrollPadOS Project
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0), firmware (<< 99.0)
